1.3 - 2026.10.01
 - Fixes a passing assertion hiding an earlier failure in the same test:
   a test now fails if any assert or refute fails.
 - Adds a summary of errors and warnings logged during a test run, naming
   the tests that logged them.
 - Adds expect_errors to the test object, for tests that trigger errors
   or warnings on purpose.
 - Adds expect_fail to the test object, for tests that are meant to fail;
   gloo-test's own failure paths now have gloo tests.
 - Reports a missing test file as an error.
 - Requires gloo 7.0 or later.


